  "title": "Banxa Transaction Issues",
  "description": " \nWhy Was My Banxa Transaction Declined?\nIf your Banxa transaction was declined, it’s likely due to payment issues, verification delays, o...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why Was My Banxa Transaction Declined?</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\">If your Banxa transaction was declined, it’s likely due to payment issues, verification delays, or automated security checks.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Common Reasons</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Payment Issues:</b> Incorrect card details or unsupported payment method</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Verification Incomplete:</b> Missing or unverified ID/payment info</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Bank Restrictions:</b> Some banks block or flag crypto-related transactions</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Security Review:</b> High-risk transactions may be auto-declined</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Order Timeout:</b> Delays in payment or verification can expire your order</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Recommended Actions</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Double-check payment and ID details</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Use a different card or payment method</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Contact your bank to confirm that crypto transactions are permitted</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Look for Banxa emails (including spam) for verification steps</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://support.banxa.com/en/support/tickets/new\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"><b>Contact Banxa Support:</b></a> <a href=\"https://support.banxa.com/en/support/tickets/new\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">https://support.banxa.com/en/support/tickets/new</a></p></li></ol>",
